+### H4 — Gateway leg settle wait (M5-T49, T57)
+The gateway tailer copies `jiramcp_gateway_decision` from `docker logs --follow`, so on a loaded
+runner the event can reach `gateway_audit.jsonl` after the test has already run `varambu trace`;
+the chain then renders without its `gateway` and `upstream` legs and the leg-count assertion fails.
+Rule: after the MCP call returns, the exercise step runs `sleep 5` and then `varambu trace --json`
+once, and the outcome guards read that single render. Five seconds covers the slowest gateway
+flush seen in the `119/120` run with margin.
